{
  "_comment": [
    "The reviewed mapping from the `self` seed profile (backend/self_seed_data.py) onto the baseload",
    "(agent/plans/oss-baseload.md section 4.2). Two parts:",
    "  intents     the intents that ship, by `<self-seed node>:<slug>`, the baseload node each lands on",
    "              and its group. Only groups in `ship_intent_groups` are seeded (decision D-B4: ship",
    "              the product-behaviour intents, hold the contributor ones). `edits` are exact",
    "              [old, new] replacements in the statement; one that no longer applies fails the run.",
    "  paragraphs  candidate paragraphs of self-seed prose, by content hash. A paragraph moves onto its",
    "              baseload node ONLY when `review` is `yes`, a person's decision; `pending` and `no`",
    "              move nothing. `python tools/gen_baseload.py candidates` refreshes the list from",
    "              `node_map` and keeps every decision already made. Every moved paragraph passes the",
    "              same forbidden patterns as authored text (check C5)."
  ],
